invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/pinned-checkers.sh
reason: lint-runtime-symbols stops checking that its llvm-nm is the
  pinned version. Its catch script runs it alone, without lint-toolchain,
  so another llvm-nm would list the runtime calls it checks.
  test/pinned-checkers.sh hands it a newer stand-in llvm-nm and requires
  it to stop on the pin.

--- old
	$(call REQUIRE_PINNED,lint-runtime-symbols,$(LLVM_NM),version $(LLVM_MAJOR)\.,LLVM $(LLVM_MAJOR))
--- new
